solutions.latex:
Using the cosine rule in triangle $JOK$:

$$\begin{aligned} JK^2 &= 63^2 + 45^2 - 2\times 63\times 45\times\cos 96^\circ \\ &= 6586.676\ldots \\ JK &= 81.158\ldots \\ &\approx 81.2 \text{ m (1 d.p.)} \end{aligned}$$

